        "sid": "MAT 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola nyarjeawda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwariteawa Yesu jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA ak ghang'eat gawa, ak gaweay heeda giinealangaaschi ak geehiimsa gissideasta gheedida sibata ASEETEAN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha niny ak gwayeesha, “Moong'uli haleanjeeni seaniin? Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, manda eara lagheaneanagi jea ghoabit aba uhuudeaba niirja jea ea majeeng'adeadu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawanadeeda ea ghabasta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea goopteada Yesu aba uhuuda Giijeeda Saytuunajeega, gaweesa giinealangaaschi aba heeda funyaat ak geanyasa hichpa geaw ak geanyaash gideaba, “Rukuni ng'asheesu gayghoah eeju? Amadu hinoadaang'u gwanda gwadeagooda jea eadaaha ghana dea muudeanooda damanda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ang'ula adiidu gwareenganeegwa sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gayghwahidu fuga saang'a nea gaygaba nih ayi, ‘Aniini geewooschi Gristo,’ ak gaygwareengani fuga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajayiinya iita ng'ucheeda ea dea ng'ucheadinga, ang'ula adaghoabealeagwa, aba gideaba ng'asheesu mayghwashiy hinnooda, amaduuku muudeanooda ea miighoaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaygang'uchi daroar ea daroar nuut, ak gang'uchi sugoocheanduumeeda ea sugoocheanduumeeda nuut, ak gaygwanda geejeeda ea sawooda ng'eanyiida aba hiji ea hiji: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suh seaniin ghang'eat ghuuta lajooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iimuchu gheeda gajealaabeagwa bwadaw eesawaneegwa amadu geenuuseegwa; gayghwasteagwa Eemoojiga sean aba badaydeanyu aba gheawungeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda fuga saang'a gajeeruusa nea gooheakiida geat nea gwasta geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gayghwahidu sibanga saang'a bea ng'uyyeega ak gaygwareengani fuga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoahaada deambiilaneanduumeeda buuneeda, hean gaygabiisa ghamwanang'iidaada bariinyeega aba jeesinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda siida jea ghamilikghta ea gamuudean ada ea siida jea ghwalaalaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicha gajeerukwiida Giijasta Miy bea sugoocheanduumeeda aba ng'eanyiisean ghoah muuwuunooda aba eemoojiga sean, ama ng'ata abeeda ghwahidu muudeanooda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawanadeeda haw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi iyoadaayi gidamuy jea gweadu nyariida, ghayi rugu sibaneeda siguura Danieli nea nimiinaada aba heeda ghaydit (dea asoamwa ea danala), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda fuga mida ng'eanyiida Yudeya dasalsiina giijeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida mida badayda bulaliida ea adaghwararang'aan gageanu haleanjeeda mida jeedeaba gheanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea dea mida madamnyeanda ea adagabiigu bwadaw ghamwagha hang'daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eamuy dea gheamadiga mideawa diibiga ea gea areeri diibiga aba damani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwaasha ASEETA ea moosaldani eaweeda gooroogeeda ghanea eaweeda Sabaatohi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba damani gaygwanda sawanadeeda haw manda dea deena aba deaghayi sisna ng'eanyiida ea ghoah ghamneawa, ak ea maygudu abiikta adaaha sawanadeeda uurji nih earahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghwanyawa askwearjoojisu dagheeda ea meanuwaasa ghwanyawa ea maygwanda siichea ghwalaalaan; iidu geelagu askwearjoojisu aba badahuuka fuga ghayi sibay ealoat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eaweecheanji iiyeeshineegwa sih ‘Gristo gwanda hiji!’ ghana ‘Gwanda hoowa!’ Adoamwaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gayghwahidu Gristohajeega ng'uyyeega ea sibanga ng'uyyeega. Ak gayghoahiimu gwadeagwajeega hees deamdeameadi jea ghoamu gahuteawi fuga ghayi bay ealoat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula nigeawiit dareekuseegwa aba mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iiyeeshineegwa, ‘Adaaha diida gwanda dareapcheeda,’ ea adiidu gooriti; ghana iisiyi, ‘Gwanda jeeda gheeda,’ ea adoamwaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gawuurji dadamandeedida abwaay heeda ghayeawa ea gagul heeda biyearean nih abeeda gichea gawuurji hinnooda Orjeeda Siida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda wassean mida guumeeda heeda jea gabatiisa geat madoonyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hinooda Orjeeda Siida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iimuchu nea ning'ata sawanadeedida bea askwearjoojigigeaniin, gajeenung' gamisaniit gheang'da aseeta, nea sheeda ea maygooboong'u, nea miinga mida humng'eeda gaygoobitu, nea uurda humng'eeda gajeetuumduum; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gajeadaah gwadeagooda Orjeeda Siida aba humng'eeda, abeeda eemoojiga sean bea muunda ng'eanyiida gaygagutu heareega iidaah Orjeeda Siida nea ghwaan aba badayda shamooghuutka humng'eeda nea gwandeawa uurda ea giigheambiita haw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygoojeakta malaykajeagaaschi ghaghuut muuchi durumbeati ak gaygaweay gooweamu fugaaschi loat aba murdajeega asang'wan bea ng'eanyiida, ghang'eada murdeeda humng'eeda meatkweeni ea gagul meatkweedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida anaal fih shaboogheecheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ajeeng'ni ng'asheesu eagali shaboogheecheandean: iifiirfiir damealgaaschi ak gwardu seenga, goojeeng'u gideaba damanda doomeelda nineekiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara agooga iyoadaayi ng'asheesu seaniin nea ghwahidu ghoanali gideaba nineekiisa gidaghuuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa gaydarukuneegwa gideaba mayghwanaawda seaygeani nea miighwahidu suh seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida gayghang'ata, amaduuku ng'asheegeasu ea mayghang'ata earahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manda siida nal askwearjeanda ghana damanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duuku iita askwearjeandida ghana damandida manda siida nal eaweeda jea gawaseewa eara malaykajeega humng'eeda ghana Orjeeda geaghus Bwaabwa nea gaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaygawuurji gidaghayi bea damanda Nuhu, nih gichea gawuurji hinnooda Orjeeda Siida gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba damandida ghayi miighwahina roopta hawiin abeeda buuneeda iissa gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi, gageeshi nea geaghi, ea eeyi bwak ea gawa Nuhu jeeda maleambooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea majeeng'na ea ghwahidu roopta duw ak gwaduulu buuneesean, nih abeeda gichea gawuurji hinnooda Orjeeda Siida gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida gaygwanda fih iyeenya madamnyeanda gajeegeanda agi ak geenung'usa heeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadeem iyeenya gajeahita nea gang'ealshi, ak gajeegeanda agi ak geenung'usa heeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi oang'wearni aba gideaba moanali eaweeda jea ghwahina Ng'utamiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi anala ng'asheanji gideaba inyeeda ghwanyawa ghwanal siida bea gheeda damanda eaweeda jea ghwahina mareanghweanda, gayghoang'wearu nea ghanyea mayghwanung'waada eenyarja gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara agooga asisina geat, aba gideaba Orjeeda Siida gayghwahidu damanda moorarsiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjeanda doabiiwaat ea dea mii doabiiwaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nih gajea anasihi was soomjeanda doabiiwaat mideawa weaghuumeeda, iin siidaanyi haw uhuudeaba gheanyi ak ghoadaw buuneeda daghwarda aba damandaanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana soomjeandida ama hidu Siidaanyi hawiin ghwahita nea gwasinda ng'asheega gidaghayi sirukusiindean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, gaydayeeshiineegwa, gaygageanu ak ghwayiin haghweeda haleanjeadaanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaduuku soomjeandida muyiin iiyeesha geaw aba jeadaanyi ‘Nishing'da siideanyu hawiin,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amahit gabiissa ghabwar soomjooga ama ng'ata gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi sea leeydean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gayghwahidu Siidaanyi haw bea soomjeandideani eaweeda mararsiina ea damanda mwanala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwaaga ghoorjooda, ak ghwanung' gwandeayi sea fuga amitu geat; abeeda gaygwanda shooka ea giiwiirooda geeshatka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.24.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
